From e886a8ba13e6d95304ecf4d619c7ed540ff658f5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: port <port@local>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 22:11:12 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] build: pin MonoMod to the locally rebuilt Android package

The -star pins named packages that no longer resolve anywhere. NuGet reports
them as unresolvable and silently substitutes the official release with an
NU1602 warning, so the build succeeded against official MonoMod - the build
whose PlatformTriple.CreateCurrentSystem throws NotImplementedException on
OSKind.Android - while the shipped assemblies came from the fork. A pin that
fails open is worse than one that fails.

Official MonoMod is only the base, not the answer: the Android support is
8 published commits on top of it, carried here as
references/monomod-android.patch over the official MonoMod/MonoMod commit
20ccecf. scripts/build_monomod.sh rebuilds all three packages from that pair,
and asserts that the patched tree still reproduces the published work at the
fork tip 9da670d6e, so drift in the patch fails the build.

MonoMod.Utils moves 25.0.12 -> 25.3.7-android.1 because all three packages are
produced by one build of one tree; a package set that mixes a Utils from a
different upstream version with a RuntimeDetour from the patched tree is not
something a single provenance record can describe.
---
 BepInEx.Core/BepInEx.Core.csproj                              | 4 ++--
 BepInEx.Preloader.Core/BepInEx.Preloader.Core.csproj          | 4 ++--
 .../Unity/BepInEx.Unity.IL2CPP/BepInEx.Unity.IL2CPP.csproj    | 2 +-
 3 files changed, 5 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

diff --git a/BepInEx.Core/BepInEx.Core.csproj b/BepInEx.Core/BepInEx.Core.csproj
index 01a52d5..6ab84ac 100644
--- a/BepInEx.Core/BepInEx.Core.csproj
+++ b/BepInEx.Core/BepInEx.Core.csproj
@@ -10,8 +10,8 @@
         <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.NETFramework.ReferenceAssemblies" Version="1.0.3" PrivateAssets="All"/>
         <PackageReference Include="HarmonyX" Version="2.10.2" />
         <PackageReference Include="SemanticVersioning" Version="2.0.2"/>
-        <PackageReference Include="MonoMod.Utils" Version="25.0.12-star"/>
-        <PackageReference Include="MonoMod.RuntimeDetour" Version="25.3.4-star"/>
+        <PackageReference Include="MonoMod.Utils" Version="25.3.7-android.1"/>
+        <PackageReference Include="MonoMod.RuntimeDetour" Version="25.3.7-android.1"/>
     </ItemGroup>
     <ItemGroup>
         <Compile Remove="Contract\IPlugin.cs"/>
diff --git a/BepInEx.Preloader.Core/BepInEx.Preloader.Core.csproj b/BepInEx.Preloader.Core/BepInEx.Preloader.Core.csproj
